<Layout title="Privacy | Bold Performance">
  <section class="section legal">
    <p class="eyebrow">BOLD PERFORMANCE</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated October 12, 2026.</p>
    <h2>When you contact Brock</h2>
    <p>
      Bold Performance uses information you voluntarily share, such as your
      name, email, and training goals, to respond to your inquiry and discuss
      coaching. Please do not send sensitive medical information through this
      website.
    </p>
    <h2>Website services</h2>
    <p>
      If the inquiry form is enabled, submissions are processed by{" "}
      <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/">Formspree</a>. Email,
      phone, text, and Instagram links open their respective services, whose
      privacy policies apply. This website does not include advertising trackers
      or analytics.
    </p>
    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>
      To ask about information you have shared, request its deletion, or stop
      further contact, email{" "}
      <a href="mailto:boldperformancellc@gmail.com">
        boldperformancellc@gmail.com
      </a>
      .
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/">
      ← Back to home
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
